<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="section"><div class="container legal">
  <h1>Security</h1>
  <p class="lead">How we protect your account, your data and the RegData service.</p>
  <h2>Data in transit and at rest</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>All traffic to divyrs.com uses HTTPS (TLS). Webhooks are only sent to <code>https://</code> endpoints and are signed with HMAC-SHA256 so you can verify they came from us.</li>
    <li>Passwords are stored as bcrypt hashes. API keys and session tokens are long random values; password-reset links expire after one hour and work once.</li>
    <li>The database is backed up daily and backups are kept for 14 days.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Access</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Only the account owner can see their API keys, webhooks, saved invoices, forms, bookings and cards.</li>
    <li>Administrative access is limited to the company's owner account.</li>
    <li>Login, sign-up, password-reset and contact forms are rate-limited, and cross-site form posts are blocked.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>RegData data handling</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>RegData only processes documents that regulators publish publicly. We do not ingest your customers' personal data.</li>
    <li>Names you send to the enforcement search or screening API are used only to answer that request; our application records the number of calls for billing, not the names. Standard web-server logs, kept for about 14 days, can include the address of website searches. For sensitive lists, use the POST screening API, whose names are never in an address.</li>
    <li>Watchlist names you save in a webhook are stored so we can alert you, and are deleted when you delete the webhook or your account.</li>
    <li>Public regulator documents are read with the help of AI models (Anthropic Claude). Only those public documents are sent for processing.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>Payments are handled by Razorpay. We never see or store card numbers, UPI PINs or bank passwords.</p>
  <h2>Your controls</h2>
  <p>From <a href="/dashboard/account">Account</a> you can change your password, download all your data as JSON, or delete your account.</p>
  <h2>Reporting a vulnerability</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:<%= business.email %>"><%= business.email %></a> with details and steps to reproduce. Please give us reasonable time to fix the issue before disclosing it, and don't access other users' data or degrade the service while testing. See also <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a>.</p>
  <h2>Enterprise reviews</h2>
  <p>Need a security questionnaire, a data processing agreement or an uptime commitment? <a href="/contact?topic=enterprise">Contact us</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
